pref-template-scope-item = One document per item
pref-template-scope-info = Literature note · item details
pref-template-scope-abstract = Literature note · abstract
pref-template-scope-notes = Literature note · notes (once per note)
pref-template-scope-hint = “One document per item” can have a template of its own — a reading note instead of a log entry — and the three sections of that note (details, abstract, notes) can each have one too. Leave a box empty to use the built-in shape; the variables and the syntax are the same everywhere.
pref-template-item-inherit = Empty — the common template will be used
pref-template-section-default = Built-in template — edit it to make it your own
pref-template = Template
