pref-templates-load = Load
pref-templates-delete = Delete
pref-templates-hint = A template you got right can be kept: give it a name and press “Save”, then pick it from the list and press “Load” to bring it back. With no name typed but one picked from the list, “Save” updates the one that is picked. Deleting takes two presses — the first one only asks.
